# Day 2: Swiggy Data Dashboard Using Tableau

## Objective
To practice data visualization by creating a dashboard using Swiggy restaurant data.

## Activities Completed
- Connected Swiggy data to Tableau.
- Explored and organized fields related to restaurants, locations, food categories, prices, and ratings.
- Created three worksheets for data visualization.
- Combined the worksheets into a dashboard.
- Practiced using Tableau to present data in a visual and understandable format.

## Tools Used
- Tableau
- Excel dataset

## Learning Outcome
Gained hands-on experience in connecting data, creating worksheets, and assembling a dashboard in Tableau.

## Project Files
- Tableau workbook: `day2_tableaudashboard_.twbx`
- Dashboard screenshot: `dashboard.png`

## Key Takeaway
This exercise helped me understand the basic workflow of building a dashboard, from connecting a dataset to presenting visual insights.

## Next Step
Continue learning dashboard formatting, filters, interactive features, and advanced data analysis.
